"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[19024],{19024:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/three-body-3.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Three-Body Problem 3: Death\'s End\\"\\n          author=\\"Liu Cixin\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Jaum & Moeum\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2022-02-15\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788954442718\\"\\n          rating=4\\n          tags=\\"sf\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nIn ```Death\'s End```, the author employs his imagination and scientific knowledge to explore the very nature of the ```universe```—pure hard sci-fi.  \\nThis series features a lot of talk about <mark>dimensions</mark>.  \\nI tried to visualize everything at first, but eventually, I gave up trying to imagine it all.  \\n<br>\\nThe same human greed and arrogance seen in the second book reappears in this one.  \\n<br>\\nI really didn\'t like the female protagonist. She\'s too idealistic and naive.  \\nShe couldn\'t distinguish between ideals and reality, and the consequences were disastrous.\\n<br>\\nPersonally, I felt the story could have ended with <mark>The Dark Forest</mark>.  \\nHowever, I suppose this volume was necessary for a truly complete conclusion."}')}}]);